WEBVTT

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:07.270
Project settings give the selected names the full field. Open the model list to see the badge beside the inherited option.

00:00:08.316 --> 00:00:17.156
This chat starts with Opus. Change Seismic’s model to Haiku in Configuration, and the same chat updates its default as soon as the change is saved.

00:00:24.884 --> 00:00:36.244
For this task, choose the option marked Default. The account changes its default from Gemini Flash to Gemini Pro. Reopen the picker and the saved choice follows Gemini Pro.

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:46.250
If the harness cannot name its default, the task picker says the model name is unavailable and still shows the harness and effort.
